<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="zh-TW">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>今天吃點什麼好 - 清冰箱食材匹配器</title>
  <style>
    body {
      font-family: 'PingFang TC', 'Microsoft JhengHei', sans-serif;
      background: #f4f6f7;
      padding: 15px;
      margin: 0;
      color: #2c3e50;
    }
    .card {
      background: white;
      padding: 20px;
      border-radius: 12px;
      box-shadow: 0 4px 15px rgba(0,0,0,0.08);
      max-width: 500px;
      margin: 0 auto;
    }
    h2 {
      color: #1B365D;
      text-align: center;
      margin-top: 0;
      margin-bottom: 5px;
    }
    .sub-title {
      text-align: center;
      font-size: 13px;
      color: #7f8c8d;
      margin-bottom: 20px;
    }
    .cate-title {
      font-weight: bold;
      margin-top: 15px;
      margin-bottom: 8px;
      color: #008080;
      border-bottom: 2px solid #eee;
      padding-bottom: 4px;
      font-size: 14px;
    }
    .checkbox-group {
      display: flex;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      gap: 8px;
    }
    .chip {
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      background: #eef2f5;
      border-radius: 20px;
      padding: 6px 12px;
      cursor: pointer;
      font-size: 13px;
      user-select: none;
      transition: all 0.2s;
    }
    .chip input { display: none; }
    .chip.checked {
      background: #ff6b6b;
      color: white;
      font-weight: bold;
    }
    button.btn-match {
      width: 100%;
      margin-top: 20px;
      padding: 12px;
      background: #1B365D;
      color: white;
      border: none;
      border-radius: 8px;
      font-size: 16px;
      font-weight: bold;
      cursor: pointer;
      box-shadow: 0 4px 8px rgba(27,54,93,0.2);
    }
    button.btn-match:hover { background: #008080; }
    .result-box { margin-top: 25px; }
    
    /* 食譜卡片極簡化設計 */
    .recipe-card {
      border: 1px solid #e0e0e0;
      border-left: 5px solid #008080;
      border-radius: 10px;
      padding: 15px;
      margin-bottom: 15px;
      background: #fff;
      box-shadow: 0 2px 6px rgba(0,0,0,0.04);
    }
    .recipe-header {
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
      align-items: center;
      margin-bottom: 8px;
    }
    .recipe-title {
      font-weight: bold;
      color: #1B365D;
      font-size: 16px;
    }
    .tag {
      background: #e8f5e9;
      color: #2e7d32;
      padding: 3px 8px;
      border-radius: 12px;
      font-size: 12px;
      font-weight: bold;
    }
    .recipe-detail {
      font-size: 13px;
      color: #555;
      line-height: 1.5;
      margin-bottom: 12px;
    }
    /* 跳轉按鈕樣式 */
    .btn-link {
      display: block;
      text-align: center;
      background: #008080;
      color: white;
      text-decoration: none;
      padding: 10px;
      border-radius: 6px;
      font-size: 14px;
      font-weight: bold;
      transition: background 0.2s;
    }
    .btn-link:hover {
      background: #1B365D;
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>

<div class="card">
  <h2>🥬 冰箱有什麼？幫你匹配食譜！</h2>
  <div class="sub-title">💡 勾選手邊現有食材，為您搜尋最適合的 15 分鐘極速料理：</div>

  <!-- 1. 肉類與海鮮 -->
  <div class="cate-title">🥩 肉類 / 海鮮</div>
  <div class="checkbox-group">
    <label class="chip"><input type="checkbox" value="beef">火鍋牛肉片</label>
    <label class="chip"><input type="checkbox" value="pork">火鍋豬肉片</label>
    <label class="chip"><input type="checkbox" value="minced_pork">豬絞肉</label>
    <label class="chip"><input type="checkbox" value="chicken">去骨雞腿/雞胸肉</label>
    <label class="chip"><input type="checkbox" value="spam">午餐肉/培根/火腿</label>
    <label class="chip"><input type="checkbox" value="shrimp">蝦仁/蛤蜊</label>
    <label class="chip"><input type="checkbox" value="salmon">煙燻鮭魚</label>
  </div>

  <!-- 2. 蔬菜類 -->
  <div class="cate-title">🥦 蔬菜 / 菇類 / 辛香料</div>
  <div class="checkbox-group">
    <label class="chip"><input type="checkbox" value="onion">洋蔥</label>
    <label class="chip"><input type="checkbox" value="cabbage">高麗菜/青菜</label>
    <label class="chip"><input type="checkbox" value="kimchi">韓式泡菜</label>
    <label class="chip"><input type="checkbox" value="tomato">大蕃茄/小蕃茄</label>
    <label class="chip"><input type="checkbox" value="basil">九層塔</label>
    <label class="chip"><input type="checkbox" value="cucumber">小黃瓜</label>
    <label class="chip"><input type="checkbox" value="mushroom">金針菇/菇類</label>
    <label class="chip"><input type="checkbox" value="chili_pepper">剝皮辣椒</label>
  </div>

  <!-- 3. 主食與蛋豆類 -->
  <div class="cate-title">🍚 主食 / 蛋豆腐 / 火鍋料</div>
  <div class="checkbox-group">
    <label class="chip"><input type="checkbox" value="rice">白飯</label>
    <label class="chip"><input type="checkbox" value="udon">烏龍麵</label>
    <label class="chip"><input type="checkbox" value="pasta">義大利麵</label>
    <label class="chip"><input type="checkbox" value="ramen">韓式泡麵/鍋燒麵</label>
    <label class="chip"><input type="checkbox" value="noodle">關廟麵/乾麵/冬粉</label>
    <label class="chip"><input type="checkbox" value="toast">吐司/貝果/薄餅</label>
    <label class="chip"><input type="checkbox" value="egg">雞蛋</label>
    <label class="chip"><input type="checkbox" value="tofu">嫩豆腐/板豆腐</label>
    <label class="chip"><input type="checkbox" value="cheese">起司片/乳酪絲</label>
    <label class="chip"><input type="checkbox" value="hotpot_mats">火鍋料/蟹肉棒/關東煮</label>
  </div>

  <button class="btn-match" onclick="matchRecipes()">開始匹配食譜 🔍</button>

  <div class="result-box" id="results"></div>
</div>

